{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program a robot to solve logic puzzles in ChipWits, an open-ended programming game for beginners and experts alike! Inspired by the 1980s original, ChipWits combines the best of puzzle games, automation, and programming to introduce a new generation of players to a classic gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/bdb0b35bdba21041e29f6fc77e9777b7.avif?t=1763329231\" width=599 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a humble robot, ChipWit Model CW-03.24, and learn the ropes of automating its activities. Place chips to instruct your ChipWit\u2019s movement across the factory floor, building on skills learned in previous areas to solve increasingly complex puzzles to help Professor Chip open his first factory. Order these chips to find a solution to each floor, then press play to watch your ChipWit accomplish its goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/761f1547150a5108d0ce8281b3c592a7.avif?t=1763329231\" width=599 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChipWits is designed to mimic programming, with no prior experience required. Each puzzle has multiple solutions and can be resolved in unique and clever ways. Experiment with different chip combinations to achieve your goal, and see how your performance compares to the global leaderboard!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every solution can be optimized to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Maximize your score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Minimize the number of chips used</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Minimize the number of cycles (steps) it takes for your program to run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/9e665343d9d7154331f82a4756c168fd.poster.avif?t=1763329231\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/9e665343d9d7154331f82a4756c168fd.webm?t=1763329231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/9e665343d9d7154331f82a4756c168fd.mp4?t=1763329231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/84356caeaa71503e7a8184d111996cd8.avif?t=1763329231\" width=599 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChipWits reimagines the original 1984 game of the same name. This reboot offers an accessible introduction to programming, featuring thorough tutorials, familiar automation controls, and a diverse range of puzzle solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/753aefb25f4460331f2c4b71176d907b.avif?t=1763329231\" width=614 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/f5271f6f72b827894096c854787b9aa5.avif?t=1763329231\" width=599 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community (link in the sidebar) to learn how to become a beta tester, connect with fellow players, share tips, and stay updated on the latest game news and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Graduated With Honors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/020426b8910a3749dc89158dde1c79be903d6608.jpg"},{"name":"Feast Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/b532b05bea0e3c84a654ffe9818154c641763bd3.jpg"},{"name":"Conveyor King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/ef52ce45d14501e0fefbd741f6788caa7a7e93e4.jpg"},{"name":"The Professor's Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/b13176cd041a5c4d2db2a696d36991cdbd3bc50d.jpg"},{"name":"No Stone Unturned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/dd05e6655adbd34514eab29d7669034ed2691e24.jpg"},{"name":"Every Last Circuit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/4b72ffd65dafcd1ce3004c2f0c3734ca73770cf6.jpg"},{"name":"Live Wire Debut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/95a9fdb132ec7fc18170b2b80e2904f48fc34344.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/7f4415619774b3a941d188338f4be73a2cc04c42.jpg"},{"name":"Vintage Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/ed92912c2bc635dc9bcc74f35625431e4df110aa.jpg"},{"name":"The OG ChipWit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330720/0744212fa8cd12e6c84a61d7d227477a1d164d88.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330720?t=1763329231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763329231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/4df64da9ccd97e6f2f776bc9de101e14d8b68f00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763329231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/4df64da9ccd97e6f2f776bc9de101e14d8b68f00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763329231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2849200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program a robot to solve logic puzzles in ChipWits, an open-ended programming game for beginners and experts alike! Inspired by the 1980s original, ChipWits combines the best of puzzle games, automation, and programming to introduce a new generation of players to a classic gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330720/extras/bdb0b35bdba21041e29f6fc77e9777b7.avif?t=1763329231\" width=599 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a humble robot, ChipWit Model CW-03.24, and learn the ropes of automating its activities. Place chips to instruct your ChipWit\u2019s movement across the factory floor, building on skills learned in previous areas to solve increasingly complex puzzles to help Professor Chip open his first factory. Order these chips to find a solution to each floor, then press play to watch your ChipWit accomplish its goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragra